  "0_outline_root": "ROOT: Date/Time Format > Requirements",
  "0_outline_lines": [
    "L007: \"Column conforming to DateTimeFormat attribute MUST adhere to the following requirements:\"",
    "  L009: \"[*FOCUS dataset column*](#glossary:FOCUS-dataset-column) MUST be expressed in UTC (Coordinated Universal Time) to avoid ambiguity and ensure consistency across different time zones.\"",
    "  L010: \"*FOCUS dataset column* MUST conform to the ISO 8601 standard, which provides a globally recognized format for representing dates and times (see [ISO 8601-1:2019](https://www.iso.org/standard/70907.html) governing document for details).\"",
    "  L011: \"When column represents a specific moment in time, *FOCUS dataset column* MUST adhere to the following requirements:\"",
    "    L012: \"*FOCUS dataset column* MUST use the extended ISO 8601 format with UTC offset (`YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ssZ`).\"",
    "    L013: \"*FOCUS dataset column* MUST include both the date and time components, separated with the letter `T`.\"",
    "    L014: \"*FOCUS dataset column* MUST use two-digit hours (`HH`), minutes (`mm`), and seconds (`ss`).\"",
    "    L015: \"*FOCUS dataset column* MUST end with the ISO 8601 UTC designator `Z`.\""
  ],
